--- !u!114 &1304502212
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1304502196}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c530a24ea0ef8d34990d94afbefe7c3f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - You have no real idea why your mom decided to uproot your life so rudely. Maybe
    she felt nostalgic for her childhood home. Maybe she wanted distance from your
    dad after he tragically passed years ago, under mysterious circumstances.
  - 'But you have a sneaking suspicion it had to do with your FAMILY SWORD. '
  - Every family had one, passed down from generation to generation. Some were said
    to possess terrible strength, or the wisdom of the entire family lineage.  -
    yours seemed entirely useless besides starting fights, and not the physical kind.
  - Before he passed, your dad had always hated the family sword - He said violence
    was behind us and wanted it gone. However violence was not past your mother.
  - She spent every day afraid that the Ninja would return - and kept the sword by
    her side until one day she deemed you worthy
